'''Electric Generator''' (Japanese: '''エレキジェネレーター''' ''Electric Generator'') is an {{TCGP|Item card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Flip a coin. If heads, take a {{e|Lightning}} Energy from your Energy Zone and attach it to 1 of your Benched {{e|Lightning}} Pokémon.
}}

