==Trivia==
This card's effect is similar to the {{TCG|Electric Generator}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], as both allow players to attach extra {{e|Lightning}} Energy to Benched {{e|Lightning}} Pokémon.

===Origin===
This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Electric Generator|170}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.

